 @HeloisGevit  DLSS 1 was worse than even AMD's CAS sharpening. FSR is nothing like those two so minimizing FSR to DLSS 1 when amd has a superior solution already in cas is disingenuous to say the least.

There are many explanations of how FSR works and I won't waste my time explaining the whole process. Just reducing resolution and sharpening is not what FSR does and suggesting it can produce the same results and FPS gain as FSR is misinformation.

Hardware unboxed has seen the raw files without YouTube compression and more footage that wasn't in the demo and if they say it is close in visual quality to native then I believe them over digital foundry that spread nvidea's bullshit on how the 3080 was twice as fast as the 2080 when it was in one vram restricted use case while in reality it was 30% faster.
